  "name": "Rail Rate Reply",
  "description": "This Draft Standard for Trial Use contains the format and establishes the data contents of the Rail Rate Reply Transaction Set (463) for use within the context of an Electronic Data Interchange (EDI) environment. This transaction set can be used to reply to a Rail Rate Transaction from the receiver's application process based on data content or business rules. This transaction set is used as an application acceptance, application rejection or to indicate that no data was found for a request.",
